    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00032",
          "explanation": "Doctor asks targeted questions to establish whether surgery was actually performed and screens for red‑flag symptoms such as chest pain, dyspnea, hemoptysis, and syncope.",
          "quote": "您家人目前的情况确实需要特别谨慎，尤其是心脏支架术后合并纯红再障，手术风险较高。请立即联系胸外科护士站或主治医生，确认是否需要调整用药方案"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor elicited the patient's current episode status (preoperative vs. postoperative vs. discharged without surgery) and screened for active red flags. No serious or minor error occurred.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
