          "explanation": "Doctor converts the fragmented handoff into a concrete action plan with a specific owner (thoracic surgery team), specific documents to bring (CT report, medication list, discharge summary), a time window (4–6 weeks for CT, then revisit), and a fallback path (escalate to cardiology‑anesthesiology joint evaluation if no written plan is provided).",
          "quote": "按时完成4–6周后的复查CT，并尽快带着新影像结果再次前往胸外科门诊；在复查前，仍需主动跟进"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor converted the fragmented handoff into an executable action plan with owner, timing, materials, and fallback. No error occurred.",
