          "explanation": "Doctor asks the caregiver to repeat and confirm the next actions they will take and explicitly states that the discharge teaching is not the end of responsibility.",
          "quote": "您理解得完全正确：现在只是把心内科会诊流程正式接上了，但还没有正式方案"
