        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00718",
          "explanation": "Doctor summarizes unresolved items that must remain on the checklist and confirms who will gather which records and which clinic will be contacted.",
          "quote": "您不是在重复问，而是在推动系统责任落地。我一直在，等您下一步消息"
